      "writtenOn": "2024-06-20T05:19:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The code RAM does not recommend doing the FETCH LOCK test. The location of the instruction is not fixed. Therefore, setting the fetch-lock protection area in code ram will lead to unexpected behavior. Because we don\u0027t know what instructions will be placed in the protected area.",
      "parentUuid": "13b23f4e_fc85e1d3",
      "revId": "ca97c6a92d7748db4166956b4fb89ae270c5bb0e",
